\newlabel{fig:reaction_heatmaps}{{5}{7}{Cross-sectional heatmaps detailing the spatial distribution of key neutronic reactions. (a) Displays the density of tritium breeding reactions, strictly localised within the discrete breeder layers. (b) Illustrates the concentration of neutron multiplication events across the blanket depth}{figure.caption.5}{}}
