\newlabel{fig:fluence_hms}{{6}{8}{Cross-sectional heatmaps of flux and radiation damage. (a) Illustrates the progressive attenuation of the neutron flux across the material boundaries. (b) Shows the spatial distribution of structural radiation damage}{figure.caption.6}{}}
